   "source": [
    "## Dysanos\n",
    "\n",
    "Assume that \n",
    "$$\n",
    "    C(S_t,T,K) := \\sum_j \\alpha_j(T-\\tau_j) \\sum_i q_t^{i,j} C(S_t k^{i,j}; K; T, V(T))\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2e167b74",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Features $f^i \\in R^d$ for $i=1,\\ldots,1000$\n",
    "$$\n",
    "    h = NN\\left( \n",
    "        \\sum_i MM( f^j ) e^{-K(f^i) }\n",
    "        \\right)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
